[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
What the agent can't do without you:

[00:04.0 --> 00:15.0]
A secret enters rysh once -- even the line you typed is masked, in the buffer and in the history. Persisted, git-ignored.

[00:15.0 --> 00:26.0]
And every edit queues behind a human gate. This one is still waiting. That's the point.

[00:26.0 --> 00:30.0]
Trust is a mechanism. rysh dot A I.
